  "Leveling order (resourceLevelingOrder)": "Порядок выравнивания (resourceLevelingOrder)",
  "Fast mode (resourceLevelingFunctionalityFastModeEnabled)": "Быстрый режим (resourceLevelingFunctionalityFastModeEnabled)",
